DESCRIPTION:Niceville Senior Center opens its shuffleboard courts to membe
 rs age 55 and up for casual\, all-skill-levels play throughout the day. T
 he center frames it as relaxed social play with a little friendly competi
 tion\, not a formal league. City of Niceville residents get free Senior C
 enter membership\, though the nonresident fee is not posted online\, and 
 no admission price is published for this particular session. The open pla
 y session also repeats on multiple weekdays through September\, so this i
